#shaders/lang/zh_CN.lang
# VertaLux v6.0 简体中文翻译（AI 初翻，未人工校对）
# 源文件：VertaLuxV6.zip 的 shaders/lang/en_us.lang
# VertaLux - menu labels (EN)
# Menu: ONE global quality scale (the profile) + 4 screens - Quality / Water &
# sky / Ambience / Image. Every visible option is an ON/OFF switch or a NAMED
# TIER; no raw number is ever displayed on a control.
# This file holds ONLY the keys of the 5 reachable screens (see the layout
# convention and the accessibility audit in shaders.properties). EN and FR carry
# strictly the same key set: 4 profiles, 4 screens, 92 options.
# THE ORDER OF THIS FILE IS THE ORDER OF THE MENU, block for block. Keep it that
# way - a key that drifts away from its screen block is a key nobody remembers
# to update. Blank lines mark the same blocks the screens separate with <empty>.

# ---- global quality scale (the profile) ----
# Same four words and the SAME FOUR COLOURS as every tier in the pack: the
# player reads one single scale, from the profile down to the last setting.
# There is deliberately no fifth entry of a different nature next to them.
profile.POTATO=§9低配
profile.MEDIUM=§a中配
profile.HIGH=§6高配
profile.EXTREME=§4极高

# ---- screens ----
screen.QUALITY=§b⚙ 画质与性能
screen.QUALITY.comment=仅包含影响帧率的选项，别无其他。共六组：渲染分辨率（影响最大的杠杆）、阴影与遮蔽、间接光照、体积光与太阳光束、反射与材质，最后是三项开关位于“水面与天空”屏幕的分级。总开关始终位于其控制分级的左侧，若某分级有两个开关则位于其上一行。
screen.NATURE=§9☁ 水面、天空与云
screen.NATURE.comment=你在水面与天空上实际看到的内容。共四组：水面、水下、云层，然后是太阳、月亮与星辰。除水体色调、云量与星辰亮度为命名分级外，其余均为开关。
screen.AMBIANCE=§d✨ 氛围与世界
screen.AMBIANCE.comment=世界的氛围，每项一个开关。共五组：雾与薄雾、群系赋予空气的颜色、天气与季节、灯光与火焰，然后是下界、末地与传送门。
screen.IMAGE=§6◐ 画面与相机
screen.IMAGE.comment=画面，按渲染链的计算顺序排列。共五组：基础调色（曝光、对比度、饱和度）、色调映射曲线、画面特效、镜头与相机，最后是 FXAA。

# ============ SCREEN 1/4 - QUALITY & PERFORMANCE ============

# -- block 1: render resolution --
option.TAA=时间性抗锯齿（TAA）
option.TAA.comment=随时间累积帧：平滑边缘、稳定间接光照、无锯齿闪烁。借助邻域钳制将重影降至最低。其右侧即为其控制的 TAA 渲染与超分总开关。
option.TAA_MODE=TAA 渲染与超分
option.TAA_MODE.comment=游戏以更低分辨率渲染，再由 TAA 提升回屏幕分辨率。超高质量 = 不超分（100%）。高质量 = 72% 像素，均衡 = 56%，性能 = 44%，超级性能 = 25%。本光影包中影响帧率最大的杠杆。关闭 TAA 时无效。
value.TAA_MODE.0=超高质量 
value.TAA_MODE.1=质量
value.TAA_MODE.2=§e均衡
value.TAA_MODE.3=性能
value.TAA_MODE.4=超高性能 
option.TAA_QUALITY=画面稳定性
option.TAA_QUALITY.comment=帧之间混合的精细程度——不要与上方选择渲染分辨率的设置混淆。此处修复闪烁与微小移动时的柔化。低配：廉价版本，使用原始邻域且仅读取一次上一帧而非五次——唯一能回收帧率的档位。中配：迄今为止默认的混合方式，锐化重建上一帧并统计剔除拖影。高配：在此之上，每个像素都会测量自身帧间不稳定性并据此精确放宽钳制阈值——这才得以稳定平滑表面（间接光照、反射），这些是邻域钳制永远无法保护的对象，且相机转动时屏幕边缘不再出现生硬截断。实测：闪烁减半且画面更接近真正的抗锯齿，而无需额外的纹理读取。关闭 TAA 时无效。
value.TAA_QUALITY.0=§a低配
value.TAA_QUALITY.1=§a中配
value.TAA_QUALITY.2=高

# -- block 2: shadows & occlusion --
option.SHADOW_QUALITY=阴影质量
option.SHADOW_QUALITY.comment=优先阴影清晰度，其次是范围。阴影纹素从 0.025 降至 0.0094 方块（分辨率 1024 →
value.SHADOW_QUALITY.0=§a低配
value.SHADOW_QUALITY.1=§a中配
value.SHADOW_QUALITY.2=高
value.SHADOW_QUALITY.3=极高
option.SHADOW_SHARP_LEVEL=Near shadow sharpness
option.SHADOW_SHARP_LEVEL.comment=Shadow LOD, axis 1 of 2: like real games, shadow resolution now falls with distance — a plateau of CONSTANT fine detail around you, then a firm falloff. This tier sets the plateau magnification: ×3.3 / ×5 / ×7 / ×10 the base texel of Shadow quality (at the default map that is 5.6 / 3.8 / 2.6 / 1.9 cm per shadow texel). FREE in FPS: the map is redistributed, never enlarged — what the center gains, mid-distance and the border pay. High is the calibrated default (closest to the pack's previous look); Very high buys a ×10 center but visibly coarser mid-range shadows, best paired with a Short range on the right.
value.SHADOW_SHARP_LEVEL.0=§a低配
value.SHADOW_SHARP_LEVEL.1=§a中配
value.SHADOW_SHARP_LEVEL.2=高
value.SHADOW_SHARP_LEVEL.3=极高
option.SHADOW_SHARP_RANGE=Sharp shadow range
option.SHADOW_SHARP_RANGE.comment=Shadow LOD, axis 2 of 2: how far the sharp plateau reaches before detail starts dropping — 12 / 20 / 32 / 48 blocks asked. FREE, same trade as the sharpness: a longer plateau is paid at mid-distance and at the border of the shadow range. The delivered radius is capped by the shadow-map budget, so the top notches can COINCIDE at a given Shadow quality. At High sharpness the four notches deliver 12 / 20 / 21 / 21 blocks on Medium shadows (the default — Long and Very long are then identical), 12 / 14 / 14 / 14 on Low, 12 / 20 / 28 / 28 on High, 12 / 20 / 32 / 42 on Very high — and the higher the sharpness level, the shorter the reachable range. The quality profiles walk this axis 0→3.
value.SHADOW_SHARP_RANGE.0=短
value.SHADOW_SHARP_RANGE.1=§a中配
value.SHADOW_SHARP_RANGE.2= §7Fog
value.SHADOW_SHARP_RANGE.3=非常长
option.AO=环境光遮蔽（SSAO）
option.AO.comment=Corners, crevices and contact areas darken naturally. The detail that changes everything. Its sample count follows Shadow quality, on its left.
option.PARTICLE_SHADOWS=粒子阴影
option.PARTICLE_SHADOWS.comment=Particles (smoke, drips, rain splashes...) and the first-person hand receive real sun and cloud shadows like the terrain. OFF = lightmap-only shading. Far particles keep a fast one-tap path.
value.PARTICLE_SHADOWS.0=§8OFF
value.PARTICLE_SHADOWS.1=§aON
option.PIXEL_SHADOWS=Pixel-perfect shadows
option.PIXEL_SHADOWS.comment=Shadow edges become STAIRS locked to the 16×16 texture pixels of the blocks — the voxel look. Every screen pixel inside one block texel reads the shadow map at the very same place, and the soft penumbra (PCSS) is still computed there: a shadow touching its block keeps a crisp edge, a shadow cast from far above widens into grey steps, one value per texel — the shadow is blurred, THEN pixelated. Same cost as the default shadows. Caustics follow, drawn in the same 1/16-block pixels, and so do colored shadows (stained glass) and the water's own shadow. Cloud shadows, volumetric rays, indirect light and reflections do NOT follow, by design. Shadow quality on its left still drives the map RESOLUTION, and that is what decides how far the steps stay exact: about 13 / 17 / 27 / 52 blocks from Low to Very high — further out one map texel covers several block texels and the steps grow chunkier.
value.PIXEL_SHADOWS.0=§8OFF
value.PIXEL_SHADOWS.1=§aON

# -- block 3: indirect light --
option.SSGI=ssgi（太阳光反弹）
option.SSGI.comment=One bounce of SUNLIGHT only: sunlit surfaces light their neighbors (color bleeding). Block lights stay strictly vanilla and never feed the GI. Fades out in caves. Master, with the RSM next to it, of Indirect light quality below.
option.RSM_GI=屏幕外阳光反弹（反射阴影贴图）
option.RSM_GI.comment=Uses the shadow map as a bounce source: sunlight reflects off colored surfaces EVEN off-screen. True PTGI-style color bleeding. The map covers what lies on the SUN side of your view, not a full circle around you, so a little bounce can appear when the camera turns (shadow.culling = reversed in shaders.properties buys a stable all-around map for GPU time). ALREADY ON from High upwards — Indirect light quality below turns it on by itself at its last two notches. This box is what turns it on at Low and Medium, where it is off by default. It never counts a bounce twice: a surface the camera can already see is left to SSGI.
option.GI_QUALITY=Indirect light quality
option.GI_QUALITY.comment=The single dial for indirect light. Low and Medium: screen-space bounce only (SSGI, 4 then 8 samples). High: 12 samples AND the OFF-SCREEN bounce (RSM, 16 samples) switches on — colour now arrives from geometry the camera cannot see, which is the biggest jump on this axis and the only one that changes what is lit rather than how cleanly. Very high: 24 SSGI / 24 RSM and the whole bounce computed at FULL resolution instead of a quarter of the pixels, so silhouettes stop being rebuilt by interpolation — about four times the cost. Does nothing at Low/Medium if SSGI is off and the RSM box above is unchecked.
value.GI_QUALITY.0=§a低配
value.GI_QUALITY.1=§a中配
value.GI_QUALITY.2=高
value.GI_QUALITY.3=极高
option.DENOISE_QUALITY=Indirect light stability
option.DENOISE_QUALITY.comment=How hard the bounce denoiser scrubs the frame-to-frame shimmer of the indirect light. Its temporal stage — a statistical clamp that stops the history from being crushed on sparse frames, the old cause of the faint sparkling everywhere — is always on and costs nothing, whatever this tier says. Low: temporal stage only, the delivered cost to the tap. Medium: one smoothing ring around each pixel, edges protected by depth and normals so contacts stay crisp. High: a second, wider ring — the strongest scrub. Very high: same two rings, but their width follows the MEASURED noise of each pixel — fully open on fresh or moving pixels (exactly where the shimmer lives), nearly closed on a settled image, so it is both the most stable and the sharpest tier at the same cost as High. Does nothing if SSGI is off and the RSM box above is unchecked (same masters as Indirect light quality).
value.DENOISE_QUALITY.0=§a低配
value.DENOISE_QUALITY.1=§a中配
value.DENOISE_QUALITY.2=高
value.DENOISE_QUALITY.3=极高

# -- block 4: volumetrics & sun rays --
option.VOLUMETRIC_LIGHT=体积光束
option.VOLUMETRIC_LIGHT.comment=Sunlight and moonlight made visible in the air: shafts through leaves and windows, glow around the sun. The most atmospheric effect of the pack, and what turns the dawn mist into a real volume. Master of Volumetrics quality, right next to it.
option.VOLUMETRIC_QUALITY=体积光质量
option.VOLUMETRIC_QUALITY.comment=FINENESS of the volumetric fog (fog banks, dawn mist, Nether columns) and underwater ray range. Each notch DOUBLES the march samples: above water the step shrinks (40 → 20 → 10 → 5 blocks); below water the ray RANGE grows (24 → 48 → 96 → 128 blocks) and the step tightens to 4 blocks at the last notch. Very high is the finest, longest march of the pack; like every tier it runs on a quarter of the pixels behind a depth-aware upsample (the old full-resolution march costs 4x for slightly crisper fog edges — screenshot hunters can force it back with VL_FULL_RES in lib/settings.glsl). From High up, the dawn mist banks get their full contrast. Sun rays have their own tier two lines below.
value.VOLUMETRIC_QUALITY.0=§a低配
value.VOLUMETRIC_QUALITY.1=§a中配
value.VOLUMETRIC_QUALITY.2=高
value.VOLUMETRIC_QUALITY.3=极高
option.GODRAYS=云隙光
option.GODRAYS.comment=Sky light streams radially from the sun, cut by geometry. These are the AIR rays: over water they are trimmed to the share of the view that really is air, because the beams inside the water are drawn by the underwater ray system instead. Master, on the air side, of Sun ray quality below.
option.UW_VOLUMETRICS=水下体积雾
option.UW_VOLUMETRICS.comment=Depth-graded volumetric fog and caustic god rays under the water surface (Beer-Lambert extinction). OFF = flat underwater fog only. Master, on the underwater side, of Sun ray quality below.
option.SUNRAY_QUALITY=Sun ray quality
option.SUNRAY_QUALITY.comment=Sample count of the crepuscular rays in air AND the finesse of the underwater light shafts (substeps and render distance). Does nothing if both switches on the line above are off.
value.SUNRAY_QUALITY.0=§a低配
value.SUNRAY_QUALITY.1=§a中配
value.SUNRAY_QUALITY.2=高
value.SUNRAY_QUALITY.3=极高

# -- block 5: reflections & materials --
option.SSR_ENABLED=水反射 (SSR)
option.SSR_ENABLED.comment=Screen-space reflections on the water: everything already drawn on screen is mirrored by the surface. The base of every water reflection. Master of Reflection quality, right next to it.
option.REFLECT_QUALITY=反射质量
option.REFLECT_QUALITY.comment=Budget of the raymarch that draws EVERY reflection in the pack (water, glass, PBR metals): REACH of the reflection (20 to 64 steps, so off-screen objects are found further and further out) and PRECISION of the hit point (4 to 8 refinement passes divide the impact error by 16, 32, 64 then 256, which is what stops a reflection from sliding along an edge). Does nothing if Water reflections is off.
value.REFLECT_QUALITY.0=§a低配
value.REFLECT_QUALITY.1=§a中配
value.REFLECT_QUALITY.2=高
value.REFLECT_QUALITY.3=极高
option.PBR_TEXTURES=PBR纹理（labpbr）
option.PBR_TEXTURES.comment=Uses the resource pack's normal and specular maps when present. Master of Material quality, right next to it.
option.PBR_QUALITY=Material quality
option.PBR_QUALITY.comment=Number of roughness-blur taps used on reflections: how many samples a rough surface averages before it looks soft instead of grainy. Does nothing if PBR textures is off.
value.PBR_QUALITY.0=§a低配
value.PBR_QUALITY.1=§a中配
value.PBR_QUALITY.2=高
value.PBR_QUALITY.3=极高
option.PBR_POM=视差浮雕（高度贴图）
option.PBR_POM.comment=视差映射：根据资源包高度贴图雕刻浮雕效果。实验性功能——部分资源包可能出现视觉瑕疵。
option.GLASS_EFFECTS=玻璃效果
option.GLASS_EFFECTS.comment=所有玻璃的菲涅尔反射、微折射与太阳闪烁效果。

# -- block 6: tiers whose master lives on the Water & sky screen --
option.CLOUD_QUALITY=云层质量
option.CLOUD_QUALITY.comment=FINENESS of the cloud volume, then draw distance. Both rise together: the march goes from 8 to 48 steps while the range goes from 700 to 1800 blocks, so the step shortens from 87 to 37 blocks and the cumulus gain relief at every notch. Turned on and off by "Volumetric clouds", and its COVERAGE is set, on the Water & sky screen.
value.CLOUD_QUALITY.0=§a低配
value.CLOUD_QUALITY.1=§a中配
value.CLOUD_QUALITY.2=高
value.CLOUD_QUALITY.3=极高
option.WAVE_QUALITY=Wave quality
option.WAVE_QUALITY.comment=Swell train count, number of rungs on the wave ladder (from the long swell down to the fine chop) and parallax-occlusion steps on the near water. Turned on and off by "Water waves", on the Water & sky screen.
value.WAVE_QUALITY.0=§a低配
value.WAVE_QUALITY.1=§a中配
value.WAVE_QUALITY.2=高
value.WAVE_QUALITY.3=极高
option.CAUSTIC_QUALITY=Caustics quality
option.CAUSTIC_QUALITY.comment=Low = analytic caustics (cheapest). Medium = photon-density net evaluated on the sea you actually see. High = same net, shaped into a continuous caustic instead of a two-tone stencil. Three notches only: there is no useful fourth state. Turned on and off by "Underwater caustics", on the Water & sky screen.
value.CAUSTIC_QUALITY.0=§a低配
value.CAUSTIC_QUALITY.1=§a中配
value.CAUSTIC_QUALITY.2=高

# ============ SCREEN 2/4 - WATER, SKY & CLOUDS ============

# -- block 1: the water surface --
option.WATER_SKY_TINT=Sky in the water
option.WATER_SKY_TINT.comment=The colour of the SKY REFLECTED IN THE WATER — not the sky itself, which never moves. Past about eight blocks the water pixel IS that reflection: 70% of it at ten blocks, 96% at twenty, 99% at sixty — the colour of the water MEDIUM is fixed to its natural calibration, so this reflection is what decides the colour of open water. FOUR NAMED STEPS: Azure (physical) is the untouched physical mirror; Slight, Medium and Strong (Medium is the look that ships) pivot the reflected sky out of azure and drain its saturation, at EXACTLY constant Rec.709 brightness — the water gets warmer and less "swimming pool", never darker and never washed out. Two things are deliberately spared: the SUN, whose disc comes through bit for bit at every step, and the whole GOLD PATH of a sunset, which is measured at zero change because the step only ever bites on blue. An assumed artistic choice, not physics.
value.WATER_SKY_TINT.0=§9Azure (physical)
value.WATER_SKY_TINT.1=§aSlight
value.WATER_SKY_TINT.2=§a中配
value.WATER_SKY_TINT.3=强
option.WATER_WAVES=水面波浪
option.WATER_WAVES.comment=A formed sea on the water surface: long crossed crest lines from the swell down to the fine chop, exact analytic normals, and a far ocean crushed toward mirror at grazing angles with a tight sun-glitter path. OFF = a flat vanilla plane. Master of Wave quality (Quality screen).
option.WATER_REFRACTION=水折射
option.WATER_REFRACTION.comment=Bends what you see through the surface with the wave normals. Ships disabled: OFF = no distortion, and no cost.
option.WATER_CAUSTICS=水下焦散
option.WATER_CAUSTICS.comment=Computed from the wave field: focused light follows the swell. Master of Caustics quality (Quality screen).
option.WATER_MICRONORMAL=水面微波纹
option.WATER_MICRONORMAL.comment=涌浪之上叠加的细微波纹细节，近看使水面呈现哑光、被风拂过的颗粒感。
option.WATER_FOAM=边缘泡沫
option.WATER_FOAM.comment=水体与岸边及固体方块交界处的白色泡沫。

# -- block 2: underwater --
option.UNDERWATER_FX=水下效果
option.UNDERWATER_FX.comment=斯涅尔窗口、悬浮颗粒、随深度渐变的雾。总控其后三项设置。
option.UW_BIOME_TINT=水下群系色调
option.UW_BIOME_TINT.comment=水下雾与光束将采用群系水体颜色（保持物理亮度）。
option.UW_PARTICLES=悬浮粒子
option.UW_PARTICLES.comment=精细水下粒子。默认关闭。
option.UW_VIGNETTE=水下暗角
option.UW_VIGNETTE.comment=头部处于水下时使屏幕四角变暗。

# -- block 3: the clouds --
option.VOLUMETRIC_CLOUDS=体积云
option.VOLUMETRIC_CLOUDS.comment=锚定于世界中的真实 3D 云：视差、自阴影、银边。总控其右侧的云量以及云品质（位于品质界面）。
option.CLOUD_AMOUNT=云朵覆盖度
option.CLOUD_AMOUNT.comment=积云占据天空的比例。低 = 晴天时的零星云岛，极高 = 阴沉的天空。游戏内天气仍会对此进行调节。
value.CLOUD_AMOUNT.0=§a低配
value.CLOUD_AMOUNT.1=§a中配
value.CLOUD_AMOUNT.2=高
value.CLOUD_AMOUNT.3=极高
option.CLOUD_LAYER_ALTO=高积云层
option.CLOUD_LAYER_ALTO.comment=第二层云：位于积云之上的中高空斑驳高积云层。
option.CLOUD_LAYER_CIRRUS=卷云层
option.CLOUD_LAYER_CIRRUS.comment=第三层云：高空稀薄的卷云薄纱。也是日晕出现所需。
option.VC_GROUND_SHADOWS=地面云影
option.VC_GROUND_SHADOWS.comment=云层阴影在地形上漂移。

# -- block 4: sun, moon and stars --
option.SUN_HALO=太阳光晕 (22°)
option.SUN_HALO.comment=太阳（夜间为月亮）周围的冰晶光晕，仅在稀薄的高空薄纱掠过视野时出现：内缘偏红，外缘呈白蓝色，内部天空略暗。浓厚的云层会同时遮住太阳和光晕。
